<title>USA: U.S. official says Saudi bombing suspect arrives.</title>
<headline>U.S. official says Saudi bombing suspect arrives.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A high-ranking U.S. official said a Saudi man implicated in the 1996 truck bombing that killed 19 U.S. airmen in Saudi Arabia a year ago arrived on Tuesday in the United States from Canada.</p>
<p>The official confirmed that a plane carrying the suspect, Hani Abdel-Rahim Hussein al-Sayegh, who had previously been held in an Ottawa prison, arrived in the Washington, D.C., area on Tuesday night.</p>
</text>
